#   - add the release's own Zenodo DOI to `identifiers` (see ReadMe.md,
#     "Major Releases"; v0.3.0 does not currently record one)
#   - add ORCID identifiers for both authors
# Authorship reflects project contribution, not commit counts: the git history
# has a single committer, so the author list cannot be derived from it. Confirm
# it is complete before publishing a release intended for citation.
